    "en": {
      "trackName": "Black Dice: Dice Roller",
      "description": "Black Dice is a simple, beautiful dice roller with real physics. Roll one to eight 3D dice on your iPhone or iPad and watch them tumble, bounce and collide. One more die lives on your Apple Watch.\n\nTap or shake to roll. No ads, no clutter, no sign-up.\n\nUse it for board games, backgammon, tabletop nights, quick decisions, or whenever the real dice have gone missing.\n\nFEATURES\n• Real physics: dice bounce and collide with each other\n• 1 to 8 dice at once\n• Shake or tap to roll\n• Vibration on every roll\n• Apple Watch app\n• No ads\n\nFREE AND PRO\nBlack Dice is free with 30 rolls a day. Black Dice Pro gives you unlimited rolls and keeps your screen on during a game.\n\nPro is an optional purchase. Payment is charged to your Apple Account. Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can manage or cancel in your Apple Account settings.\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/",
      "releaseNotes": "• Real physics: dice now tumble, bounce and collide with each other like the real thing\n• Black Dice Pro: unlimited rolls and a screen that stays on while you play\n• Free version now includes 30 rolls a day",
